{"slug": "C_S03E08", "video_name": "Community - S03E08 - Documentary Filmmaking - Redux Bluray-1080p Proper.mkv", "subtitle_name": "Community - S03E08 - Documentary Filmmaking - Redux Bluray-1080p Proper.en.srt", "duration_seconds": 1285.498, "language": "en", "stt_provider": "local", "stt_model": "ggml-small.en-q5_1.bin", "segment_count": 549, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 2.0, "text": "Why did I go Greendale?"}, {"start": 2.0, "end": 7.0, "text": "So I can keep my job and get busy with my education."}, {"start": 7.0, "end": 10.0, "text": "To meet different people."}, {"start": 10.0, "end": 13.0, "text": "Because Greendale's a slam dunk."}, {"start": 13.0, "end": 15.0, "text": "So why should you?"}, {"start": 15.0, "end": 16.0, "text": "Why should you?"}, {"start": 16.0, "end": 17.0, "text": "Why should you go Greendale?"}, {"start": 17.0, "end": 18.0, "text": "That's easy."}, {"start": 18.0, "end": 22.0, "text": "Greendale has the most advanced typing class in the Southwestern Greendale area."}, {"start": 22.0, "end": 24.0, "text": "And now you can register by fax."}, {"start": 24.0, "end": 25.344827586206897, "text": "Go Greendale!"}, {"start": 25.344827586206897, "end": 26.689655172413794, "text": "Go Greendale!"}, {"start": 26.689655172413794, "end": 27.0, "text": "Go!"}, {"start": 27.0, "end": 32.0, "text": "That, as you probably know, is the currently running commercial for our school."}, {"start": 32.0, "end": 35.0, "text": "Yeah, I always see it during late night marathons of Fantasy Island."}, {"start": 35.0, "end": 36.0, "text": "That's not an accident."}, {"start": 36.0, "end": 38.0, "text": "It's the result of intensive targeting."}, {"start": 38.0, "end": 41.7752808988764, "text": "But now, Greendale's school board has given me a"}, {"start": 41.7752808988764, "end": 45.0, "text": "budget of $2,000 to update our little ad."}, {"start": 45.0, "end": 46.0, "text": "Are you sure it should change?"}, {"start": 46.0, "end": 49.0, "text": "I chose Greendale over City College because of the way that one dude goes."}, {"start": 52.0, "end": 54.0, "text": "You know I love to be seen agreeing with you, Troy."}, {"start": 54.0, "end": 58.0, "text": "But this is our chance to make Greendale's most reasonable dreams come true."}, {"start": 58.0, "end": 60.0, "text": "And I need your help."}, {"start": 60.0, "end": 62.0, "text": "All of you."}, {"start": 62.0, "end": 63.75, "text": "That's okay, Jeffrey."}, {"start": 63.75, "end": 65.0, "text": "You can say no."}, {"start": 65.0, "end": 67.21311475409836, "text": "This school asks very little of its students."}, {"start": 67.21311475409836, "end": 68.0, "text": "It mainly gives."}, {"start": 68.0, "end": 71.0, "text": "I feel like you guys might know what I'm talking about."}, {"start": 71.0, "end": 72.0, "text": "How can we help?"}, {"start": 74.7595, "end": 76.7595, "text": "Oh, thanks for asking."}, {"start": 76.7595, "end": 80.7595, "text": "I've chosen you, Greendale's brightest, most coincidentally diverse,"}, {"start": 80.7595, "end": 84.7595, "text": "Hispanics not withstanding, study group 2 star in our commercial."}, {"start": 84.7595, "end": 87.7595, "text": "Pick a character we start this weekend."}, {"start": 87.7595, "end": 88.7595, "text": "Oh, look, it's you and me on TV."}, {"start": 88.7595, "end": 91.7595, "text": "But if we're shooting this weekend, where are these cameras here?"}, {"start": 91.7595, "end": 94.7595, "text": "Abed, true to form, has decided to do the weird thing"}, {"start": 94.7595, "end": 97.7595, "text": "and film a documentary instead of helping."}, {"start": 97.7595, "end": 99.7595, "text": "As a student of character, I have a feeling that trying to make this commercial"}, {"start": 99.7595, "end": 101.7595, "text": "may cost the Dean his sanity."}, {"start": 101.7595, "end": 103.7595, "text": "And my camera follows the fire, not the smoke."}, {"start": 103.7595, "end": 104.7595, "text": "Ever seen Hearts of Darkness?"}, {"start": 104.7595, "end": 106.7595, "text": "Way better than Apocalypse Now."}, {"start": 106.7595, "end": 108.7595, "text": "What's the catering search going to be on this picture?"}, {"start": 108.7595, "end": 109.7595, "text": "This isn't Hollywood Pierce."}, {"start": 109.7595, "end": 113.7595, "text": "If it was, these glasses would be tinted and I'd be friends with Stevie Nicks."}, {"start": 113.7595, "end": 114.7595, "text": "No catering."}, {"start": 114.7595, "end": 115.7595, "text": "This is outrageous."}, {"start": 115.7595, "end": 117.7595, "text": "I'm not leaving my trailer till there's food."}, {"start": 117.7595, "end": 118.7595, "text": "You don't have a trailer."}, {"start": 118.7595, "end": 121.0452142857143, "text": "Well, then I'll rent a trailer and I won't leave"}, {"start": 121.0452142857143, "end": 122.7595, "text": "it till I have the one I don't have."}, {"start": 122.7595, "end": 124.7595, "text": "I'm an actor, not a circus freak."}, {"start": 124.7595, "end": 125.7595, "text": "Oh, no."}, {"start": 125.7595, "end": 127.7595, "text": "I need to go that way."}, {"start": 127.7595, "end": 129.7595, "text": "Eh, I'll loop around."}, {"start": 143.7595, "end": 157.7595, "text": "[MUSIC]"}, {"start": 157.7595, "end": 158.7595, "text": "All right."}, {"start": 158.7595, "end": 160.7595, "text": "Let's rehearse this mamma-jamma."}, {"start": 160.7595, "end": 162.7595, "text": "Does everyone know who they are?"}, {"start": 162.7595, "end": 163.7595, "text": "Where's my script, girl?"}, {"start": 163.7595, "end": 165.7595, "text": "It's Supervisor and I'm right behind you."}, {"start": 165.7595, "end": 167.7595, "text": "Thank you, Supervisor Girl."}, {"start": 167.7595, "end": 169.7595, "text": "Faster than a locomotive."}, {"start": 169.7595, "end": 172.7595, "text": "A script supervisor is the person that tells everyone to stay on script"}, {"start": 172.7595, "end": 175.7595, "text": "and keeps careful notes to prevent logical inconsistencies."}, {"start": 175.7595, "end": 178.7595, "text": "So, basically, the star."}, {"start": 178.7595, "end": 179.7595, "text": "We open."}, {"start": 179.7595, "end": 182.7595, "text": "On a typical day at Greendale, only the students all look happy"}, {"start": 182.7595, "end": 184.7595, "text": "and you can't smell that smell."}, {"start": 184.7595, "end": 185.7595, "text": "Troy?"}, {"start": 185.7595, "end": 187.7595, "text": "Why do I go, Greendale?"}, {"start": 187.7595, "end": 190.7595, "text": "With three kids at home, you better believe every penny counts."}, {"start": 190.7595, "end": 191.7595, "text": "To meet different people."}, {"start": 191.7595, "end": 193.7595, "text": "And then you and Troy hug?"}, {"start": 193.7595, "end": 195.7595, "text": "If you're comfortable with that."}, {"start": 195.7595, "end": 196.7595, "text": "Of course."}, {"start": 196.7595, "end": 197.7595, "text": "Yeah, Troy and our buds."}, {"start": 197.7595, "end": 198.7595, "text": "Best buds."}, {"start": 198.7595, "end": 199.7595, "text": "Air buds, even."}, {"start": 199.7595, "end": 203.7595, "text": "[LAUGHTER]"}, {"start": 203.7595, "end": 204.7595, "text": "I'm feeling stupid."}, {"start": 204.7595, "end": 208.7595, "text": "And then the camera pans and enter Dean Pelton."}, {"start": 208.7595, "end": 210.7595, "text": "I got stuck with the role of the Dean."}, {"start": 210.7595, "end": 213.7595, "text": "So I'm gonna show him how much of a Dean I can be."}, {"start": 213.7595, "end": 216.7595, "text": "And I've got a feeling I won't make the cut."}, {"start": 216.7595, "end": 219.7595, "text": "Welcome to Dean Dale Community College, Dean."}, {"start": 219.7595, "end": 220.7595, "text": "I'm a silly goose."}, {"start": 220.7595, "end": 222.7595, "text": "Honk, honk."}, {"start": 222.7595, "end": 223.7595, "text": "Deanally do."}, {"start": 223.7595, "end": 224.7595, "text": "Look at me."}, {"start": 224.7595, "end": 225.7595, "text": "Stop."}, {"start": 225.7595, "end": 226.7595, "text": "This is my sister's outfit."}, {"start": 226.7595, "end": 228.7595, "text": "Stop."}, {"start": 228.7595, "end": 229.7595, "text": "You've hit gold."}, {"start": 229.7595, "end": 230.7595, "text": "Save some for the screen."}, {"start": 230.7595, "end": 231.7595, "text": "All right, people."}, {"start": 231.7595, "end": 232.7595, "text": "Scene six is up first."}, {"start": 232.7595, "end": 234.7595, "text": "Oh, and I don't think Pierce is coming back."}, {"start": 234.7595, "end": 236.7595, "text": "Can someone fill in his pencil?"}, {"start": 236.7595, "end": 238.7595, "text": "Pierce Hawthorne's screen is staged,"}, {"start": 238.7595, "end": 241.7595, "text": "and Star will not leave this trailer until he gets a trailer."}, {"start": 241.7595, "end": 245.7595, "text": "And then I'm not leaving that trailer until it's catering."}, {"start": 245.7595, "end": 246.7595, "text": "And I'm not eating the food until--"}, {"start": 246.7595, "end": 248.7595, "text": "And action."}, {"start": 248.7595, "end": 249.7595, "text": "Why go, Greendale?"}, {"start": 249.7595, "end": 251.7595, "text": "Just because."}, {"start": 251.7595, "end": 252.7595, "text": "Just Dean it."}, {"start": 252.7595, "end": 253.7595, "text": "Dean machine."}, {"start": 253.7595, "end": 254.7595, "text": "Got Dean?"}, {"start": 254.7595, "end": 255.7595, "text": "Got much, much, got--"}, {"start": 255.7595, "end": 256.7595, "text": "And cut."}, {"start": 256.7595, "end": 258.7595, "text": "Oh, a star is born."}, {"start": 258.7595, "end": 260.7595, "text": "I suggested to the Dean that we shoot my scenes"}, {"start": 260.7595, "end": 262.7595, "text": "in front of the Louise Guzman statue"}, {"start": 262.7595, "end": 264.7595, "text": "because the Dean has no legal right"}, {"start": 264.7595, "end": 266.7595, "text": "to broadcast Guzman's image,"}, {"start": 266.7595, "end": 268.7595, "text": "which means every shot will be unusable."}, {"start": 268.7595, "end": 271.7595, "text": "I even put a call into Guzman's lawyers to alert them."}, {"start": 271.7595, "end": 273.7595, "text": "I'm always willing to go the extra mile"}, {"start": 273.7595, "end": 274.7595, "text": "to avoid doing something."}, {"start": 274.7595, "end": 275.7595, "text": "Like sex with women."}, {"start": 275.7595, "end": 276.7595, "text": "Shut up, Leonard."}, {"start": 276.7595, "end": 278.7595, "text": "You smell like meant to lip this."}, {"start": 278.7595, "end": 279.7595, "text": "What are you even doing here?"}, {"start": 279.7595, "end": 281.7595, "text": "I'm thinking about breaking into the TV game"}, {"start": 281.7595, "end": 284.7595, "text": "since it's apparently sticking around."}, {"start": 284.7595, "end": 286.7595, "text": "I don't want to wake up in 30 years"}, {"start": 286.7595, "end": 288.7595, "text": "and wonder what if."}, {"start": 288.7595, "end": 291.7595, "text": "Because this full-time mama ain't breaking the bank"}, {"start": 291.7595, "end": 293.7595, "text": "with your expensive tuition."}, {"start": 293.7595, "end": 294.7595, "text": "Okay, cut."}, {"start": 294.7595, "end": 296.7595, "text": "Shirley, the voice."}, {"start": 296.7595, "end": 298.7595, "text": "Can you make it--"}, {"start": 298.7595, "end": 301.7595, "text": "I thought it would be more--"}, {"start": 301.7595, "end": 303.7595, "text": "What's another word that means happy-threatening?"}, {"start": 303.7595, "end": 306.7595, "text": "The word he's looking for is sassy."}, {"start": 306.7595, "end": 308.7595, "text": "He better pray you don't find it."}, {"start": 308.7595, "end": 311.7595, "text": "As soon as we get this shot, we are done."}, {"start": 311.7595, "end": 312.7595, "text": "Your phone is ringing."}, {"start": 312.7595, "end": 313.7595, "text": "Oh."}, {"start": 313.7595, "end": 315.7595, "text": "Dean Dini."}, {"start": 315.7595, "end": 316.7595, "text": "Dean Powton?"}, {"start": 316.7595, "end": 317.7595, "text": "Hey, man, how you doing?"}, {"start": 317.7595, "end": 318.7595, "text": "It's Louie Guzman."}, {"start": 318.7595, "end": 320.7595, "text": "I hear you're making a commercial for Greendale"}, {"start": 320.7595, "end": 323.7595, "text": "and you need permission to use my face or something."}, {"start": 323.7595, "end": 325.7595, "text": "Well, I, um--"}, {"start": 325.7595, "end": 328.7595, "text": "Well, why not use the real thing?"}, {"start": 328.7595, "end": 329.7595, "text": "I'm sorry?"}, {"start": 329.7595, "end": 332.7595, "text": "I'm saying, I'd love to be in your commercial."}, {"start": 332.7595, "end": 334.7595, "text": "Wowie!"}, {"start": 334.7595, "end": 339.7595, "text": "A real big-time celebrity wants to be in my commercial!"}, {"start": 339.7595, "end": 341.7595, "text": "Wowie, a real big-time celebrity"}, {"start": 341.7595, "end": 342.7595, "text": "wants to be in my commercial."}, {"start": 342.7595, "end": 343.7595, "text": "Come on down."}, {"start": 343.7595, "end": 344.7595, "text": "Yeah, that's cool, but listen."}, {"start": 344.7595, "end": 346.7595, "text": "I gotta finish this movie, so, you know,"}, {"start": 346.7595, "end": 348.7595, "text": "I can't call for a couple of weeks, all right?"}, {"start": 348.7595, "end": 349.0595, "text": "Mr."}, {"start": 349.0595, "end": 349.7595, "text": "Guzman."}, {"start": 349.7595, "end": 350.7595, "text": "Luis, thank you."}, {"start": 350.7595, "end": 353.7595, "text": "And can I just say, I loved you in--"}, {"start": 353.7595, "end": 354.7595, "text": "[snaps fingers]"}, {"start": 354.7595, "end": 356.7595, "text": "In--"}, {"start": 356.7595, "end": 360.7595, "text": "[humming]"}, {"start": 360.7595, "end": 362.7595, "text": "IMDB."}, {"start": 362.7595, "end": 364.7595, "text": "How you doing, man?"}, {"start": 364.7595, "end": 367.7595, "text": "That was tragic."}, {"start": 367.7595, "end": 368.7595, "text": "The students here mean well."}, {"start": 368.7595, "end": 369.7595, "text": "They really do."}, {"start": 369.7595, "end": 372.7595, "text": "But what Greendale has always needed is a miracle."}, {"start": 372.7595, "end": 374.7595, "text": "This is it."}, {"start": 374.7595, "end": 376.7595, "text": "This is how I get to put Greendale on the map."}, {"start": 376.7595, "end": 379.7595, "text": "You know, I thought this commercial was gonna be okay."}, {"start": 379.7595, "end": 380.7595, "text": "Well, guess what?"}, {"start": 380.7595, "end": 382.7595, "text": "It just officially became great."}, {"start": 382.7595, "end": 383.7595, "text": "Let me give you a little rundown"}, {"start": 383.7595, "end": 385.7595, "text": "of this commercial's great elements."}, {"start": 385.7595, "end": 388.7595, "text": "Luis Guzman is in it."}, {"start": 392.7595, "end": 394.7595, "text": "I'm sorry, will you excuse me?"}, {"start": 394.7595, "end": 396.7595, "text": "Everyone gather around."}, {"start": 396.7595, "end": 397.7595, "text": "Quick announcement."}, {"start": 397.7595, "end": 398.7595, "text": "Come on around."}, {"start": 398.7595, "end": 401.7595, "text": "Everything that we shot so far is worthless."}, {"start": 401.7595, "end": 402.7595, "text": "I've thrown it out,"}, {"start": 402.7595, "end": 404.7595, "text": "and we're starting over tomorrow morning."}, {"start": 404.7595, "end": 405.7595, "text": "Why?"}, {"start": 405.7595, "end": 409.7595, "text": "Because Luis Guzman is in the commercial now."}, {"start": 409.7595, "end": 410.7595, "text": "Oh, I love Luis Guzman."}, {"start": 410.7595, "end": 412.7595, "text": "So, yeah, for realsings."}, {"start": 412.7595, "end": 413.7595, "text": "Everyone, go home."}, {"start": 413.7595, "end": 415.7595, "text": "I'm rewriting all of your parts."}, {"start": 415.7595, "end": 417.7595, "text": "Ooh."}, {"start": 417.7595, "end": 418.7595, "text": "Except for you, Jeffrey."}, {"start": 418.7595, "end": 420.7595, "text": "You have locked into something here,"}, {"start": 420.7595, "end": 424.7595, "text": "and the only thing your character needs"}, {"start": 424.7595, "end": 427.7595, "text": "is more screen time."}, {"start": 427.7595, "end": 428.7595, "text": "It's great that he got a celebrity,"}, {"start": 428.7595, "end": 430.7595, "text": "but why reshoot everything?"}, {"start": 430.7595, "end": 431.7595, "text": "Perfectionism."}, {"start": 431.7595, "end": 432.7595, "text": "The Dean's first step down a road"}, {"start": 432.7595, "end": 434.7595, "text": "that ends in self-destruction."}, {"start": 434.7595, "end": 436.7595, "text": "That sounds horrible."}, {"start": 436.7595, "end": 439.7595, "text": "Actually, I might end up taking this to some festivals."}, {"start": 446.7595, "end": 449.7595, "text": "The Dean's production has taken over the entire school."}, {"start": 449.7595, "end": 450.7595, "text": "Classes are shut down."}, {"start": 450.7595, "end": 452.7595, "text": "The Quilting Club is being forced to sew costumes."}, {"start": 452.7595, "end": 456.7595, "text": "Two females, both 5'10\", one brunette, one with asthma."}, {"start": 456.7595, "end": 459.7595, "text": "He's also using the PA system for casting calls."}, {"start": 459.7595, "end": 462.7595, "text": "Okay, everyone, does everyone have their new script?"}, {"start": 462.7595, "end": 465.7595, "text": "Uh, it says I'm supposed to be a book, reading a book."}, {"start": 465.7595, "end": 466.7595, "text": "That doesn't make sense."}, {"start": 466.7595, "end": 467.7595, "text": "Ahem."}, {"start": 472.7595, "end": 473.7595, "text": "What's this?"}, {"start": 473.7595, "end": 475.7595, "text": "Scene four."}, {"start": 475.7595, "end": 477.7595, "text": "Last night, I had an epiphany."}, {"start": 477.7595, "end": 479.7595, "text": "I'm ready to step this mother up a notch."}, {"start": 479.7595, "end": 481.7595, "text": "This commercial is gonna push every button,"}, {"start": 481.7595, "end": 483.7595, "text": "starting with the one that is so hot,"}, {"start": 483.7595, "end": 485.7595, "text": "it will sizzle your finger."}, {"start": 485.7595, "end": 487.7595, "text": "Race."}, {"start": 487.7595, "end": 489.7595, "text": "And action."}, {"start": 489.7595, "end": 491.7595, "text": "To meet different people."}, {"start": 491.7595, "end": 492.20394444444446, "text": "Cut."}, {"start": 492.20394444444446, "end": 493.7595, "text": "I'm coming in."}, {"start": 498.7595, "end": 503.7595, "text": "I am trying to pull a 400-year-old dagger out of this nation's heart,"}, {"start": 503.7595, "end": 506.7595, "text": "and you two are hugging."}, {"start": 507.7595, "end": 509.7595, "text": "I understand, but you..."}, {"start": 509.7595, "end": 510.7595, "text": "What did I do?"}, {"start": 510.7595, "end": 511.7595, "text": "You didn't."}, {"start": 511.7595, "end": 512.7595, "text": "Let's take it again."}, {"start": 512.7595, "end": 514.7595, "text": "To meet different people."}, {"start": 515.7595, "end": 516.7595, "text": "Again."}, {"start": 516.7595, "end": 518.7595, "text": "To meet different people."}, {"start": 519.7595, "end": 520.7595, "text": "I need more!"}, {"start": 520.7595, "end": 521.7595, "text": "More!"}, {"start": 521.7595, "end": 522.7595, "text": "Wrong!"}, {"start": 522.7595, "end": 523.7595, "text": "Fight the power!"}, {"start": 523.7595, "end": 525.7595, "text": "Fight it with your hugs!"}, {"start": 525.7595, "end": 527.7595, "text": "Tear down those walls!"}, {"start": 528.7595, "end": 530.7595, "text": "Can you get this wrong one more time?"}, {"start": 530.7595, "end": 532.7595, "text": "I'm segregating the school."}, {"start": 532.7595, "end": 534.7595, "text": "To meet different people."}, {"start": 534.7595, "end": 537.7595, "text": "You can't even do it when we're helping you!"}, {"start": 538.7595, "end": 539.7595, "text": "Can somebody help?"}, {"start": 539.7595, "end": 541.7595, "text": "To meet different people!"}, {"start": 541.7595, "end": 543.7595, "text": "Stop saying I'm different!"}, {"start": 543.7595, "end": 546.7595, "text": "Dean, we spent 12 hours on the scene."}, {"start": 546.7595, "end": 548.7595, "text": "Maybe it's time to move on to something else."}, {"start": 548.7595, "end": 551.7595, "text": "I'm in psych 101, and even I don't know what's happening."}, {"start": 551.7595, "end": 554.7595, "text": "The Dean is going insane and taking all of you with him."}, {"start": 554.7595, "end": 556.7595, "text": "If you know that, then do something."}, {"start": 556.7595, "end": 558.2322272727273, "text": "I'm doing everything I can."}, {"start": 558.2322272727273, "end": 559.7595, "text": "I only have so many cameras."}, {"start": 564.5749999999999, "end": 567.5749999999999, "text": "I spent an entire day in this thing for no reason."}, {"start": 567.5749999999999, "end": 569.5749999999999, "text": "What are the shoot drags on for another day?"}, {"start": 569.5749999999999, "end": 571.5749999999999, "text": "Or, God forbid, two?"}, {"start": 574.5749999999999, "end": 575.1249999999999, "text": "And action."}, {"start": 575.1249999999999, "end": 575.5749999999999, "text": "And move."}, {"start": 575.5749999999999, "end": 577.5749999999999, "text": "This full-time mama ain't breaking the bag."}, {"start": 577.5749999999999, "end": 578.5749999999999, "text": "Cut, cut, cut, cut, cut, cut."}, {"start": 578.5749999999999, "end": 582.5749999999999, "text": "Garrett, you're not taking advantage of the motion capture technology."}, {"start": 582.5749999999999, "end": 583.5749999999999, "text": "You have to move."}, {"start": 583.5749999999999, "end": 584.5749999999999, "text": "I forgot what I am again!"}, {"start": 584.5749999999999, "end": 585.8249999999999, "text": "Oh, for crying!"}, {"start": 585.8249999999999, "end": 587.5749999999999, "text": "You are a microscope!"}, {"start": 588.5749999999999, "end": 589.5749999999999, "text": "No, that's a toilet."}, {"start": 589.5749999999999, "end": 592.5749999999999, "text": "No, that's clearly a frog who can't get out of a box."}, {"start": 592.5749999999999, "end": 594.5749999999999, "text": "Jeff thinks he has it bad."}, {"start": 594.5749999999999, "end": 597.5749999999999, "text": "As Jeff's understudy, I have to wear my Jeff wig on top of my Chang hair,"}, {"start": 597.5749999999999, "end": 599.5749999999999, "text": "and then my ball cap on top of that."}, {"start": 599.5749999999999, "end": 601.5749999999999, "text": "There's no air getting through here."}, {"start": 601.5749999999999, "end": 603.5749999999999, "text": "I'm literally dying."}, {"start": 603.5749999999999, "end": 604.5749999999999, "text": "But you'll never hear my story."}, {"start": 604.5749999999999, "end": 608.5749999999999, "text": "I mean, now you heard it, but that was close."}, {"start": 608.5749999999999, "end": 610.5749999999999, "text": "Are you sure you can't work a little faster?"}, {"start": 610.5749999999999, "end": 612.5749999999999, "text": "Nobody asked for perfection."}, {"start": 612.5749999999999, "end": 613.5749999999999, "text": "Well, perfection is what you're getting."}, {"start": 613.5749999999999, "end": 616.5749999999999, "text": "And if you don't like it, you can fire it."}, {"start": 616.5749999999999, "end": 620.5749999999999, "text": "If we don't like it, at this point, we definitely will fire you."}, {"start": 620.5749999999999, "end": 620.9596153846153, "text": "Good!"}, {"start": 620.9596153846153, "end": 622.5749999999999, "text": "That's how I like it!"}, {"start": 622.5749999999999, "end": 623.5749999999999, "text": "Ha!"}, {"start": 623.5749999999999, "end": 625.5749999999999, "text": "I'm surrounded by assassins."}, {"start": 625.5749999999999, "end": 627.5749999999999, "text": "My own school's paper has turned on me."}, {"start": 627.5749999999999, "end": 629.5749999999999, "text": "But when this is all over,"}, {"start": 629.5749999999999, "end": 632.5749999999999, "text": "I'll have a commercial with Louise Guzman in it, and all they'll have."}, {"start": 632.5749999999999, "end": 634.5749999999999, "text": "Are their words, and their fears,"}, {"start": 634.5749999999999, "end": 638.5749999999999, "text": "and whatever embarrassing photos they can get from my two-faced mother."}, {"start": 639.5749999999999, "end": 641.5749999999999, "text": "Garrett, I've got two men and diapers here."}, {"start": 641.5749999999999, "end": 642.5749999999999, "text": "I know one of them is."}, {"start": 642.762, "end": 645.462, "text": "them as playing the dawn of a new era in education but I've got nothing on the"}, {"start": 645.462, "end": 646.0316202531645, "text": "other one."}, {"start": 646.0316202531645, "end": 647.968329113924, "text": "Oh I'm just a guest of the Dean's."}, {"start": 647.968329113924, "end": 649.962, "text": "Well, both of you go that way then."}, {"start": 649.962, "end": 654.2819999999999, "text": "The Dean had his seventh epiphany today which has given me an epiphany of my own."}, {"start": 654.2819999999999, "end": 655.7333924050632, "text": "The Dean is a genius."}, {"start": 655.7333924050632, "end": 656.6318734177214, "text": "He has to be."}, {"start": 656.6318734177214, "end": 659.742, "text": "If he isn't I've given almost two weeks of my"}, {"start": 659.742, "end": 660.9825405405405, "text": "life to an idiot."}, {"start": 660.9825405405405, "end": 665.1419999999999, "text": "That is unacceptable therefore the Dean is a genius and I"}, {"start": 665.1419999999999, "end": 666.8062105263158, "text": "will die protecting his vision."}, {"start": 666.8062105263158, "end": 669.222, "text": "Are you by any chance familiar with Stockholm"}, {"start": 669.222, "end": 669.733948051948, "text": "syndrome?"}, {"start": 669.733948051948, "end": 673.4882337662337, "text": "Is it something that the Dean created because if not I don't care."}, {"start": 673.4882337662337, "end": 673.602, "text": "We"}, {"start": 673.602, "end": 675.5118734177215, "text": "all want to go but the Dean won't let us."}, {"start": 675.5118734177215, "end": 677.2819999999999, "text": "I think Pierce played this as smart as"}, {"start": 677.2819999999999, "end": 678.0318666666666, "text": "from the beginning."}, {"start": 678.0318666666666, "end": 680.242, "text": "He's probably at home watching forensic files and eating"}, {"start": 680.242, "end": 682.9419999999999, "text": "cheesy popcorn."}, {"start": 685.722, "end": 687.4175844155844, "text": "Well, about time."}, {"start": 687.4175844155844, "end": 690.2103116883117, "text": "Hey, that's for Luis Guzman."}, {"start": 690.2103116883117, "end": 693.4019999999999, "text": "Well, when you get me my trailer"}, {"start": 693.4019999999999, "end": 695.0335789473684, "text": "he can have it back."}, {"start": 695.0335789473684, "end": 697.7256842105263, "text": "They make it as nice as this one."}, {"start": 697.7256842105263, "end": 698.4598947368421, "text": "Hey Dean."}, {"start": 698.4598947368421, "end": 698.8677894736842, "text": "Dean."}, {"start": 698.8677894736842, "end": 699.602, "text": "Hey Dean."}, {"start": 699.602, "end": 701.8313670886075, "text": "Pierce mistook me for the Dean today."}, {"start": 701.8313670886075, "end": 702.735164556962, "text": "I want windows."}, {"start": 702.735164556962, "end": 704.362, "text": "How did that make you feel?"}, {"start": 704.362, "end": 707.3552394366196, "text": "I've become a stranger to myself."}, {"start": 707.3552394366196, "end": 708.534394366197, "text": "I'm bald now."}, {"start": 708.534394366197, "end": 710.5298873239435, "text": "I've always been bald."}, {"start": 710.5298873239435, "end": 710.8019999999999, "text": "I'm"}, {"start": 710.8019999999999, "end": 714.7785890027958, "text": "really dreamt of having hair and"}, {"start": 714.7785890027958, "end": 718.0095675675675, "text": "now the bald man is awake."}, {"start": 718.0095675675675, "end": 718.6203783783783, "text": "Jeff?"}, {"start": 718.6203783783783, "end": 719.842, "text": "It's time."}, {"start": 721.842, "end": 723.496794520548, "text": "It's Dean."}, {"start": 723.496794520548, "end": 724.6551506849315, "text": "Action."}, {"start": 724.6551506849315, "end": 727.4683013698631, "text": "Why go Greendale?"}, {"start": 727.4683013698631, "end": 729.6195342465754, "text": "Just because."}, {"start": 729.6195342465754, "end": 730.2814520547946, "text": "Cut."}, {"start": 730.2814520547946, "end": 730.9433698630138, "text": "Cut."}, {"start": 730.9433698630138, "end": 733.9219999999999, "text": "Lose the bald cap."}, {"start": 736.7699999999999, "end": 737.5113333333333, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 737.5113333333333, "end": 739.8835999999999, "text": "I don't like it."}, {"start": 739.8835999999999, "end": 741.5145333333332, "text": "It's hokey."}, {"start": 741.5145333333332, "end": 742.9971999999999, "text": "It's fake."}, {"start": 742.9971999999999, "end": 744.7763999999999, "text": "Take it off."}, {"start": 744.7763999999999, "end": 745.2211999999998, "text": "No."}, {"start": 745.2211999999998, "end": 747.8899999999999, "text": "I beg your pardon?"}, {"start": 750.9889999999999, "end": 751.5413287671232, "text": "Actor?"}, {"start": 751.5413287671232, "end": 755.4076301369862, "text": "I have worn this stupid thing for 12 days."}, {"start": 755.4076301369862, "end": 757.709, "text": "I have made bald friends."}, {"start": 757.709, "end": 759.2289999999999, "text": "Well that's your mistake."}, {"start": 759.2289999999999, "end": 760.3842, "text": "Because it's a lie."}, {"start": 760.3842, "end": 762.269, "text": "It's Hollywood crap and I won't"}, {"start": 762.269, "end": 765.428493670886, "text": "allow it in my commercial."}, {"start": 765.428493670886, "end": 766.7652025316455, "text": "You're not."}, {"start": 766.7652025316455, "end": 768.2234303797468, "text": "Oh yes I am."}, {"start": 768.2234303797468, "end": 771.8689999999999, "text": "Well then you're wrong for the"}, {"start": 771.8689999999999, "end": 773.0446756756756, "text": "part."}, {"start": 773.0446756756756, "end": 775.6311621621621, "text": "Understudy."}, {"start": 775.6311621621621, "end": 777.9825135135135, "text": "That's it."}, {"start": 777.9825135135135, "end": 781.5095405405406, "text": "That's reality."}, {"start": 781.5095405405406, "end": 787.387918918919, "text": "When you're done go home."}, {"start": 787.387918918919, "end": 789.269, "text": "Go home."}, {"start": 789.269, "end": 792.6788630136986, "text": "Okay I don't know why but this is the last straw."}, {"start": 792.6788630136986, "end": 794.3489999999999, "text": "As a licensed psychology"}, {"start": 794.3489999999999, "end": 798.3489999999999, "text": "major I'm declaring this production of violation of human rights."}, {"start": 798.3489999999999, "end": 799.1489999999999, "text": "You have made"}, {"start": 799.1489999999999, "end": 801.0566923076922, "text": "us prisoners of your insanity."}, {"start": 801.0566923076922, "end": 802.4556666666665, "text": "Shut your face Britta."}, {"start": 802.4556666666665, "end": 804.1089999999999, "text": "If the Dean wants his role"}, {"start": 804.1089999999999, "end": 807.7123333333333, "text": "to be played by a Chinese man in a blonde whip."}, {"start": 807.7123333333333, "end": 809.6289999999999, "text": "Oh my god you are insane."}, {"start": 809.6289999999999, "end": 813.949, "text": "Alright I'm sick and tired of hearing complaints that I'm forcing people to"}, {"start": 813.949, "end": 814.8727735849056, "text": "be here."}, {"start": 814.8727735849056, "end": 820.069, "text": "Anyone who doesn't want to help me can leave."}, {"start": 830.1089999999999, "end": 833.9089999999999, "text": "I've been stopped."}, {"start": 833.9089999999999, "end": 834.9645555555554, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 834.9645555555554, "end": 837.709, "text": "Keep rolling."}, {"start": 847.069, "end": 849.9704925373134, "text": "Hello hello hello."}, {"start": 849.9704925373134, "end": 854.3227313432835, "text": "Hello with me Louis Guzman."}, {"start": 854.3227313432835, "end": 855.289895522388, "text": "Hello."}, {"start": 855.289895522388, "end": 855.7734776119402, "text": "Hi."}, {"start": 855.7734776119402, "end": 856.2570597014924, "text": "Hi."}, {"start": 856.2570597014924, "end": 856.7406417910446, "text": "Mr."}, {"start": 856.7406417910446, "end": 857.8689999999999, "text": "Guzman."}, {"start": 865.9209999999999, "end": 868.7918860759493, "text": "Dean/director Craig Pelton."}, {"start": 868.7918860759493, "end": 871.3437848101265, "text": "Sorry I've been editing."}, {"start": 871.3437848101265, "end": 874.3209999999999, "text": "It's a little bit of a mess."}, {"start": 874.3209999999999, "end": 875.6569036144577, "text": "What the f*** is that?"}, {"start": 875.6569036144577, "end": 876.8106385542168, "text": "Oh that's a possum."}, {"start": 876.8106385542168, "end": 879.361, "text": "Once you spend some time with them you see"}, {"start": 879.361, "end": 882.8683684210527, "text": "they're just like big gentle rats."}, {"start": 882.8683684210527, "end": 884.1062631578948, "text": "I'm the guy."}, {"start": 884.1062631578948, "end": 885.241, "text": "I'm no one."}, {"start": 885.241, "end": 886.5820526315789, "text": "That's a bit."}, {"start": 886.5820526315789, "end": 887.201, "text": "It's a"}, {"start": 887.201, "end": 888.2366164383561, "text": "little bit odd."}, {"start": 888.2366164383561, "end": 892.241, "text": "Now without further ado here is the commercial you will be"}, {"start": 892.241, "end": 896.961, "text": "starring in."}, {"start": 912.161, "end": 913.7934050632911, "text": "I gotta make a phone call."}, {"start": 913.7934050632911, "end": 917.121, "text": "I had to tell this Dean I couldn't do his commercial."}, {"start": 917.121, "end": 919.2302957746479, "text": "He didn't take that too well either."}, {"start": 919.2302957746479, "end": 920.8122676056338, "text": "Y'all gotta help this dude."}, {"start": 920.8122676056338, "end": 921.281, "text": "I mean I"}, {"start": 921.281, "end": 923.400493670886, "text": "aren't you his friends?"}, {"start": 923.400493670886, "end": 926.1650506329113, "text": "I'm more of a fly on the wall."}, {"start": 926.1650506329113, "end": 927.8237848101264, "text": "Why this would go."}, {"start": 927.8237848101264, "end": 928.2845443037974, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 928.2845443037974, "end": 928.5609999999999, "text": "You"}, {"start": 928.5609999999999, "end": 931.9895714285714, "text": "won't be in my commercial but you'll be in his stupid documentary."}, {"start": 931.9895714285714, "end": 932.5609999999999, "text": "All he does"}, {"start": 932.5609999999999, "end": 933.7779014084506, "text": "is follow people around."}, {"start": 933.7779014084506, "end": 936.0088873239436, "text": "Yeah but haven't you seen Heart of Darkness?"}, {"start": 936.0088873239436, "end": 936.161, "text": "Way"}, {"start": 936.161, "end": 939.6745135135135, "text": "better than the hell off of my campus you ungrateful backstabber."}, {"start": 939.6745135135135, "end": 940.161, "text": "I already"}, {"start": 940.161, "end": 941.9108734177215, "text": "got rid of your trailer."}, {"start": 941.9108734177215, "end": 943.0774556962026, "text": "I had a trailer?"}, {"start": 943.0774556962026, "end": 944.4627721518989, "text": "Can anyone hear me?"}, {"start": 944.4627721518989, "end": 945.921, "text": "I will walk off this"}, {"start": 945.921, "end": 946.684373493976, "text": "production."}, {"start": 946.684373493976, "end": 947.5171445783133, "text": "I will quit."}, {"start": 947.5171445783133, "end": 947.9335301204819, "text": "Hello?"}, {"start": 947.9335301204819, "end": 951.2646144578313, "text": "I come here to shoot this commercial for Glenda."}, {"start": 951.2646144578313, "end": 951.681, "text": "That's"}, {"start": 951.681, "end": 953.137, "text": "what you had written in the script."}, {"start": 953.137, "end": 954.3018, "text": "Oh that script was terrible."}, {"start": 954.3018, "end": 954.8009999999999, "text": "I thought it"}, {"start": 954.8009999999999, "end": 956.367567164179, "text": "was pretty good."}, {"start": 956.367567164179, "end": 958.815328358209, "text": "Of course you think that."}, {"start": 958.815328358209, "end": 960.1860746268657, "text": "You went here."}, {"start": 960.1860746268657, "end": 961.361, "text": "Oh I get it."}, {"start": 964.9079999999999, "end": 966.6035844155844, "text": "You're worse than crazy."}, {"start": 966.6035844155844, "end": 970.348, "text": "You're a shame at your school and that that statue of"}, {"start": 970.348, "end": 971.068, "text": "me out there?"}, {"start": 971.068, "end": 972.2864615384615, "text": "That's just wrong man."}, {"start": 972.2864615384615, "end": 973.7264615384615, "text": "The bronze adds 10 pounds."}, {"start": 973.7264615384615, "end": 974.668, "text": "It's not gonna be"}, {"start": 974.668, "end": 975.2747532467532, "text": "perfect."}, {"start": 975.2747532467532, "end": 976.0331948051947, "text": "Screw you."}, {"start": 976.0331948051947, "end": 980.508, "text": "I'm just saying don't worship the people leaving Greendale."}, {"start": 980.508, "end": 982.7018028169015, "text": "Worship the people that are here."}, {"start": 982.7018028169015, "end": 983.9649014084508, "text": "Worship this place."}, {"start": 983.9649014084508, "end": 985.2280000000001, "text": "It changes people's"}, {"start": 985.2280000000001, "end": 985.6257142857144, "text": "lives."}, {"start": 985.6257142857144, "end": 987.2828571428572, "text": "Look I love my time here."}, {"start": 987.2828571428572, "end": 988.7411428571429, "text": "I got laid like crazy."}, {"start": 988.7411428571429, "end": 989.8679999999999, "text": "That's way before"}, {"start": 989.8679999999999, "end": 991.6411645569619, "text": "billy nights too."}, {"start": 991.6411645569619, "end": 994.7702784810126, "text": "Look this is a special school."}, {"start": 994.7702784810126, "end": 997.795088607595, "text": "You don't deserve to be here."}, {"start": 997.795088607595, "end": 998.108, "text": "Are"}, {"start": 1008.1779999999999, "end": 1009.7444864864864, "text": "you still filming Abba?"}, {"start": 1009.7444864864864, "end": 1011.8558378378377, "text": "Yeah but try not to address me."}, {"start": 1011.8558378378377, "end": 1013.2179999999998, "text": "I'm not really here."}, {"start": 1013.2179999999998, "end": 1014.6343157894736, "text": "Neither am I."}, {"start": 1014.6343157894736, "end": 1019.1011578947368, "text": "I don't think I can finish my commercial."}, {"start": 1019.1011578947368, "end": 1021.4979999999999, "text": "But I think I know how"}, {"start": 1021.4979999999999, "end": 1024.0248571428572, "text": "your documentary ends."}, {"start": 1024.0248571428572, "end": 1029.538, "text": "Hi I'm Craig Pelton, Dean of Greendale Community"}, {"start": 1029.538, "end": 1030.0612432432433, "text": "College."}, {"start": 1030.0612432432433, "end": 1031.7617837837838, "text": "I have failed this school."}, {"start": 1031.7617837837838, "end": 1034.378, "text": "I have failed it because I thought I was"}, {"start": 1036.952, "end": 1038.6064000000001, "text": "better than Greendale."}, {"start": 1038.6064000000001, "end": 1042.592, "text": "See I went to a university so I thought it was my job"}, {"start": 1042.592, "end": 1043.7270724637683, "text": "to improve this place."}, {"start": 1043.7270724637683, "end": 1046.152, "text": "But it turns out that the only thing wrong with"}, {"start": 1046.152, "end": 1051.112, "text": "Greendale is that it's run by an insecure wreck who holds five dances in"}, {"start": 1051.112, "end": 1055.952, "text": "two talent shows a year because he's afraid that the school isn't good enough."}, {"start": 1055.952, "end": 1060.2616103896103, "text": "But Greendale is good enough because it accepts me for when I'm not."}, {"start": 1060.2616103896103, "end": 1060.8319999999999, "text": "Greendale"}, {"start": 1060.8319999999999, "end": 1066.8319999999999, "text": "is the best school in the entire world and I'm so sorry what I've done to it."}, {"start": 1066.8319999999999, "end": 1071.9827692307692, "text": "And I'm sorry what I've done to the ice cream machine."}, {"start": 1071.9827692307692, "end": 1074.272, "text": "Please no one eat out of"}, {"start": 1074.272, "end": 1078.9689696969697, "text": "it until you clean the nozzles."}, {"start": 1078.9689696969697, "end": 1082.302303030303, "text": "The janitor knows how."}, {"start": 1082.302303030303, "end": 1084.272, "text": "I'm horrible."}, {"start": 1087.232, "end": 1091.512, "text": "Gentlemen, what I'm about to show you is not the commercial you paid me to create."}, {"start": 1091.512, "end": 1095.052759493671, "text": "What I am about to show you is a glimpse into my mind and soul."}, {"start": 1095.052759493671, "end": 1095.952, "text": "Please hold your"}, {"start": 1095.952, "end": 1097.108923076923, "text": "questions until the end."}, {"start": 1097.108923076923, "end": 1099.712, "text": "I know you will have a lot of them but I'll understand"}, {"start": 1099.712, "end": 1103.032, "text": "if you'd rather I just leave."}, {"start": 1105.792, "end": 1107.7231111111112, "text": "Why do I go Greendale?"}, {"start": 1107.7231111111112, "end": 1109.5664444444446, "text": "The Dean is a genius."}, {"start": 1109.5664444444446, "end": 1111.7608888888892, "text": "To meet different people."}, {"start": 1111.7608888888892, "end": 1112.112, "text": "With"}, {"start": 1112.112, "end": 1115.4875844155845, "text": "three kids at home you better believe every penny counts."}, {"start": 1115.4875844155845, "end": 1116.3758961038961, "text": "I love my time."}, {"start": 1116.3758961038961, "end": 1116.672, "text": "I got"}, {"start": 1116.672, "end": 1117.728, "text": "laid like crazy."}, {"start": 1117.728, "end": 1118.9160000000002, "text": "So why should you?"}, {"start": 1118.9160000000002, "end": 1119.9060000000002, "text": "Why should you?"}, {"start": 1119.9060000000002, "end": 1121.952, "text": "Why should you go to Greendale?"}, {"start": 1121.952, "end": 1127.8319999999999, "text": "Greendale is the best school in the entire world."}, {"start": 1127.8319999999999, "end": 1131.552, "text": "Go Greendale, go Greendale, go!"}, {"start": 1131.552, "end": 1134.2782337662338, "text": "It's good you know what better than good."}, {"start": 1134.2782337662338, "end": 1135.076155844156, "text": "Good enough."}, {"start": 1135.076155844156, "end": 1136.672, "text": "Is there any more of the"}, {"start": 1136.672, "end": 1137.9810909090909, "text": "crazy Chinese guy?"}, {"start": 1137.9810909090909, "end": 1138.562909090909, "text": "He pops."}, {"start": 1138.562909090909, "end": 1142.272, "text": "I'm confused that's not my commercial I didn't make"}, {"start": 1142.272, "end": 1142.6304415584416, "text": "that."}, {"start": 1142.6304415584416, "end": 1145.8564155844156, "text": "Yeah yeah okay Zemeckis it moved through you."}, {"start": 1145.8564155844156, "end": 1147.5052467532466, "text": "Anyway congratulations."}, {"start": 1147.5052467532466, "end": 1147.792, "text": "That"}, {"start": 1147.792, "end": 1150.435116883117, "text": "should last us another 16 years."}, {"start": 1150.435116883117, "end": 1151.9218701298703, "text": "So uh what's next?"}, {"start": 1151.9218701298703, "end": 1153.5738181818183, "text": "Chumps rusty bucket?"}, {"start": 1153.5738181818183, "end": 1154.152, "text": "Quarter"}, {"start": 1154.152, "end": 1154.5218630136987, "text": "taps."}, {"start": 1154.5218630136987, "end": 1155.7054246575344, "text": "Did you do this?"}, {"start": 1155.7054246575344, "end": 1156.8150136986303, "text": "You did mostly."}, {"start": 1156.8150136986303, "end": 1159.552, "text": "You got the footage you needed on the"}, {"start": 1162.866, "end": 1163.2822162162163, "text": "first day."}, {"start": 1163.2822162162163, "end": 1165.5714054054056, "text": "I added a little bit of my footage to fill in the gaps."}, {"start": 1165.5714054054056, "end": 1165.9460000000001, "text": "I thought"}, {"start": 1169.0360000000003, "end": 1170.5960000000002, "text": "you were a fly on the wall."}, {"start": 1170.5960000000002, "end": 1172.9071111111114, "text": "Some flies are too awesome for the wall."}, {"start": 1172.9071111111114, "end": 1173.7160000000003, "text": "Documentarians"}, {"start": 1173.7160000000003, "end": 1177.0760000000002, "text": "are supposed to be objective to avoid having any effect on the story and yet"}, {"start": 1177.0760000000002, "end": 1180.8760000000002, "text": "we have more effect than anyone because we decide to tell it and we decide how"}, {"start": 1180.8760000000002, "end": 1181.2522162162163, "text": "it ends."}, {"start": 1181.2522162162163, "end": 1184.3560000000002, "text": "Will your story be yet another sad one of yet another man who just"}, {"start": 1184.3560000000002, "end": 1188.3560000000002, "text": "wanted to be happy or will your story acknowledge the very nature of stories"}, {"start": 1188.3560000000002, "end": 1191.476, "text": "and embrace the fact that sharing the sad ones can sometimes make them happy?"}, {"start": 1191.476, "end": 1197.5421333333336, "text": "Uh before you say anything no I've got nothing."}, {"start": 1197.5421333333336, "end": 1200.6397333333337, "text": "Can you just forgive me?"}, {"start": 1200.6397333333337, "end": 1201.1560000000002, "text": "Yep."}, {"start": 1206.7540000000001, "end": 1207.5756216216218, "text": "Why?"}, {"start": 1207.5756216216218, "end": 1211.2375731835734, "text": "Because we've all"}, {"start": 1211.2375731835734, "end": 1214.684115830116, "text": "been there which"}, {"start": 1214.684115830116, "end": 1219.2837297297299, "text": "is why we're all here."}, {"start": 1219.2837297297299, "end": 1221.9540000000002, "text": "Oh I'm a good"}, {"start": 1221.9540000000002, "end": 1222.5896164383564, "text": "Dean."}, {"start": 1222.5896164383564, "end": 1229.5813972602741, "text": "Can someone help me get a live possum out of my office?"}, {"start": 1229.5813972602741, "end": 1231.2340000000002, "text": "It just keeps"}, {"start": 1231.2340000000002, "end": 1233.5401333333334, "text": "jumping and skittering."}, {"start": 1233.5401333333334, "end": 1238.3529333333333, "text": "You think you're prepared and it skitters again?"}, {"start": 1238.3529333333333, "end": 1238.7540000000001, "text": "Okay"}, {"start": 1238.7540000000001, "end": 1241.2740000000001, "text": "see it's over."}, {"start": 1251.6660000000002, "end": 1257.194205128205, "text": "We'll be ready for you in 20 minutes Mr."}, {"start": 1257.194205128205, "end": 1258.2998461538461, "text": "Garland."}, {"start": 1258.2998461538461, "end": 1259.1290769230768, "text": "Right."}, {"start": 1259.1290769230768, "end": 1260.6493333333333, "text": "I'm a star!"}, {"start": 1260.6493333333333, "end": 1262.446, "text": "I will not be"}, {"start": 1262.446, "end": 1263.2593333333332, "text": "mitigated."}, {"start": 1263.2593333333332, "end": 1268.546, "text": "Okay you know what I'm not coming out of this trailer until I get"}, {"start": 1272.0880000000002, "end": 1274.9023589743592, "text": "a new trailer."}, {"start": 1274.9023589743592, "end": 1279.928, "text": "And get me a granola bar!"}]}